rnp
------------------------------------------
High performance C++ OpenPGP library

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libjson-c5-0.19-1
  librnp-devel-0.18.1-1bl1
  librnp0-0.18.1-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  asciidoctor-2.0.26-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  git-2.51.0-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libjson-c-devel-0.19-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/rnpgp/rnp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/rnpgp/rnp/releases/download/v0.18.1/rnp-v0.18.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack rnp-0.18.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./rnp-0.18.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/rnp-0.18.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/rnp-0.18.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librnp0-0.18.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librnp-devel-0.18.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(rnp)
  /usr/bin/rnp.exe
  /usr/bin/rnpkeys.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/rnp.README
  /usr/share/doc/rnp/LICENSE.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/rnp.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/rnpkeys.1.gz

(librnp0)
  /usr/bin/cygrnp-0.dll

(librnp-devel)
  /usr/include/rnp/rnp.h
  /usr/include/rnp/rnp_err.h
  /usr/include/rnp/rnp_export.h
  /usr/include/rnp/rnp_ver.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/rnp/rnp-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/rnp/rnp-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/rnp/rnp-targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/rnp/rnp-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/librnp.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/librnp.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/librnp.3.gz

